      "description": "A flat square analytical section with a steady header, flexible body, and reserved footer.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-overview-widget\"><h2 class=\"ds-widget-title\">Activity over time</h2><div class=\"ds-widget-body\"><strong class=\"ds-widget-value\">1,248</strong><span class=\"ds-widget-label\">Events</span></div><footer class=\"ds-widget-footer\">Example measurement</footer></section>",
